# Protected Home Sections

Do not modify the following sections. They are fixed:
- Hero section
- YouTube video section
- Time strip section
- Inside Room section
- People @hH - GOA section
- Friends @hH - GOA section
- Sponsors section
- Venue section

When a request touches `components/home/figma-home-renderer.tsx`:
1. Treat locked sections as immutable by default.
2. If a request asks to edit a locked section (including responsiveness tweaks), do not edit it; ask the user to explicitly unlock it in this rule first.
3. Any change outside locked sections must not cause visual regression in locked sections.
4. Quick responsiveness validation is the default for all locked sections at these viewport widths: 1440, 768, and 390.
5. Pass criteria for every locked section at each viewport width:
   - no overlap
   - no clipping
   - no horizontal scroll
   - no layout shift that breaks section alignment
6. If any quick responsiveness check fails, treat the task as incomplete and fix the non-locked change (or request unlock before touching locked sections).
7. Strict responsiveness validation at 1920, 1440, 1280, 1024, 820, 768, and 390 is required only when the user explicitly asks for strict checks.
8. Do not claim completion unless all requested responsiveness checks pass.
